 "rows": [
  {
   "id": "CLIP_OLEARY",
   "tag": "Half Cover (live clip)",
   "text": "Kevin O'Leary: \"...They don't need retail.\"",
   "src_in": null,
   "src_out": null,
   "edit_in": 0,
   "edit_out": 150
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "tag": "Text Centerpiece",
   "text": "Well, turns out, Nike needed retail more than anyone.",
   "src_in": 0.0,
   "src_out": 3.628,
   "edit_in": 158,
   "edit_out": 267
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "That was 2021.",
   "src_in": 4.111,
   "src_out": 5.338,
   "edit_in": 272,
   "edit_out": 309
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Nike was soaring at almost 280 billion dollars.",
   "src_in": 5.693,
   "src_out": 9.162,
   "edit_in": 314,
   "edit_out": 418
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Today? Less than 60 billion dollars.",
   "src_in": 9.553,
   "src_out": 12.012,
   "edit_in": 423,
   "edit_out": 497
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Down almost 80 percent.",
   "src_in": 12.326,
   "src_out": 13.924,
   "edit_in": 502,
   "edit_out": 550
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "It even got kicked out of the S&P 100.",
   "src_in": 14.381,
   "src_out": 16.495,
   "edit_in": 555,
   "edit_out": 618
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "tag": "Text Centerpiece",
   "text": "So what happened?",
   "src_in": 16.952,
   "src_out": 18.151,
   "edit_in": 626,
   "edit_out": 662
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "In 2020, Nike hired eBay's ex-CEO, John Donahoe.",
   "src_in": 18.616,
   "src_out": 22.303,
   "edit_in": 667,
   "edit_out": 778
  },
  {
   "id": 9,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "His plan? Cut out the middleman.",
   "src_in": 22.769,
   "src_out": 24.558,
   "edit_in": 783,
   "edit_out": 837
  },
  {
   "id": 10,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Nike pulled out of stores like DSW and Dillard's, and sent less to Foot Locker.",
   "src_in": 24.979,
   "src_out": 29.082,
   "edit_in": 842,
   "edit_out": 965
  },
  {
   "id": 11,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "Covid made it look genius.",
   "src_in": 29.436,
   "src_out": 31.038,
   "edit_in": 970,
   "edit_out": 1018
  },
  {
   "id": 12,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "Then shoppers went back to stores, and found Hoka and On where Nike used to be.",
   "src_in": 31.355,
   "src_out": 35.294,
   "edit_in": 1023,
   "edit_out": 1141
  },
  {
   "id": 13,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "And at the gym, Alo and Vuori became the new flex.",
   "src_in": 35.645,
   "src_out": 38.551,
   "edit_in": 1146,
   "edit_out": 1233
  },
  {
   "id": "CLIP_DONAHOE",
   "tag": "Half Cover (live clip)",
   "text": "John Donahoe: \"...we had over-rotated away from wholesale a little more than we intended.\"",
   "src_in": null,
   "src_out": null,
   "edit_in": 1241,
   "edit_out": 1421
  },
  {
   "id": 14,
   "tag": "Text Centerpiece",
   "text": "And that was only half the problem.",
   "src_in": 38.95,
   "src_out": 40.482,
   "edit_in": 1429,
   "edit_out": 1475
  },
  {
   "id": 15,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "Meanwhile, Nike drowned the market in the same shoes.",
   "src_in": 40.824,
   "src_out": 43.907,
   "edit_in": 1480,
   "edit_out": 1572
  },
  {
   "id": 16,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Dunks.",
   "src_in": 44.265,
   "src_out": 44.72,
   "edit_in": 1577,
   "edit_out": 1591
  },
  {
   "id": 17,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Air Force 1s.",
   "src_in": 44.883,
   "src_out": 45.727,
   "edit_in": 1596,
   "edit_out": 1621
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Retro Jordans.",
   "src_in": 45.929,
   "src_out": 46.91,
   "edit_in": 1626,
   "edit_out": 1655
  },
  {
   "id": 19,
   "tag": "Special B-roll",
   "text": "Until there was no line, and no hype.",
   "src_in": 47.181,
   "src_out": 49.24,
   "edit_in": 1660,
   "edit_out": 1722
  },
  {
   "id": 20,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "In 2024, Donahoe was out.",
   "src_in": 49.719,
   "src_out": 51.864,
   "edit_in": 1727,
   "edit_out": 1791
  },
  {
   "id": 21,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "His replacement, Elliott Hill, put it simply:",
   "src_in": 52.257,
   "src_out": 54.426,
   "edit_in": 1796,
   "edit_out": 1861
  },
  {
   "id": "CLIP_HILL",
   "tag": "Text Centerpiece (live audio)",
   "text": "Elliott Hill: \"We lost our obsession with sport.\"",
   "src_in": null,
   "src_out": null,
   "edit_in": 1869,
   "edit_out": 1959
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "tag": "B-roll",
   "text": "The fix has been brutal.",
   "src_in": 54.825,
   "src_out": 56.406,
   "edit_in": 1964,
   "edit_out": 2011
  },
  {
   "id": 23,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "Tariffs.",
   "src_in": 56.757,
   "src_out": 57.365,
   "edit_in": 2016,
   "edit_out": 2034
  },
  {
   "id": 24,
   "tag": "Full Cover",
   "text": "China down 26 percent in one quarter.",
